      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myota-prometheus"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Per-durable JetStream pending, ACK-pending, redelivery, and oldest-message age metrics are unavailable in the current live Surveyor export.** This dashboard does not turn missing series into zero. Use the linked NATS Surveyor dashboards for broker and stream details; they do not currently provide those absent Prometheus samples either. Do not infer queue health from consumer counts."
